* #variable= 8 #constraint= 8
preserved: i[a][b0] i[a][b1] i[a][b2] ;
@i[a][lb] 1 i[a][b0] 2 i[a][b1] 4 i[a][b2] >= 0 ;
@i[a][ub] 1 i[a][b0] 2 i[a][b1] 4 i[a][b2] <= 5 ;
* reified comparison, written with the equivalence shorthand: one
* label for each of the two constraints it stands for
@f[a][ge3][right] @f[a][ge3][left] f[a][ge3] <==> 1 i[a][b0] 2 i[a][b1] 4 i[a][b2] >= 3 ;
* conditional lower bound: cond and not skip together imply a >= 2
@c[a][cond] cond ~skip ==> 1 i[a][b0] 2 i[a][b1] 4 i[a][b2] >= 2 ;
* hit is implied by a >= 4
@c[a][hit] hit <== 1 i[a][b0] 2 i[a][b1] 4 i[a][b2] >= 4 ;
* guard implies an upper bound
@c[a][guard] guard ==> 1 i[a][b0] 2 i[a][b1] 4 i[a][b2] <= 3 ;
* a consequent that is trivially satisfied is implied by anything, so
* this line loses its literal entirely
@c[a][always] always ==> 1 i[a][b0] 2 i[a][b1] 4 i[a][b2] >= 0 ;
